        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "We now provide an additional comparison between GPTQ and OBQ on BERT-base/SQuAD Rajpurkar et al. (2016) and OPT-125M/WikiText2, which is one of the largest models to which OBQ can be reasonably applied.",
